I've really not used it much until my last game (with a wizard). The good thing
is that you are neutral to begin with and the helm make you either chaotic OR
lawful, i.e. all three gods are "available". The best part is that you by some small sacrifice can change the altar and get both holy and unholy water (for all those dirty selfish tricks!). Also you can make any animal almost by choice be nasty or peaceful.

One thing I have'nt tried yet (since my game is a lot of fun right now) is if you can pray to all three gods with each having individual timeout. Scenario: Low HP, uhoh, #pray, more low HP, on with helm, #pray. I don't know yet if this is possible or not, but it sure would be a great abuse.

